<title>USA: Whiting San Dist, Ind., won by Bernardi.</title>
<headline>Whiting San Dist, Ind., won by Bernardi.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Securities said it won $7</p>
<p>million of Whiting Sanitary District, Ind., sanitary district bonds,</p>
<p>1996, with a net interest cost of 5.9590 percent.</p>
</text>
